    a: 'Potrzebujemy czterech rzeczy: warsztatu z zarządem na starcie, po jednej rozmowie z osobami wykonującymi pracę w wybranych procesach, krótkiego potwierdzenia założeń w drugim tygodniu i omówienia dokumentu na koniec. Warsztat i omówienie to jedyne punkty, w których potrzebujemy całego składu naraz. Rozmowy z zespołem umawiamy pojedynczo, żeby nie zatrzymywać działu.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Nasze dane są wrażliwe. Co się z nimi dzieje?',
    a: 'NDA podpisujemy przed pierwszym dostępem. Do pomiarów wystarczają nam zwykle dane z ostatnich trzech miesięcy w zakresie jednego procesu, a tam, gdzie to możliwe, pracujemy na kopii z usuniętymi danymi osobowymi. Ustalamy z Wami, co i na jakim etapie wychodzi poza Waszą infrastrukturę, i zapisujemy to w dokumencie.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Mamy już listę pomysłów od zespołu. Czy to nie to samo?',
    a: 'Lista pomysłów mówi, co ludzi uwiera. Kolejność mówi, ile każda pozycja kosztuje i ile wraca, więc zwykle wygląda inaczej niż lista wyjściowa. Waszą listę bierzemy na wejściu i przepuszczamy przez kryteria i arkusz wyliczeń. Część pozycji spada, część awansuje, a jedna albo dwie dochodzą z rozmów z ludźmi przy procesie.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Czy po strategii musimy wdrażać z Wami?',
    a: 'Nie. Specyfikacja dwóch pierwszych wdrożeń jest opisana tak, żeby wycenił ją każdy wykonawca, a arkusz liczy dalej bez nas. Jeśli wdrażamy razem, budujemy na tej samej specyfikacji. Dokument i prawa do niego zostają u Was w każdym z tych przypadków.',
  },
];
dane['@graph'].push({
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  '@id': `${kanon}#faq`,
  mainEntity: faq.map((f) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: f.q,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '') },
  })),
});
---
<LaBase topbar={false} title={title} description={description} ctaHref="#kontakt" ctaLabel="Umów rozmowę" nav="uslugi">
<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(dane)} slot="head"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" slot="head">
<style is:global slot="head">
  /* Style tej usługi. Wspólny wygląd: src/components/usluga/Styl.astro. */

  .sa-licz{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px}
  .sa-licz > span{font-size:13px;color:var(--t2)}
  .sa-licz > b{font-size:clamp(22px,2vw,28px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1;color:var(--t1)}
  .sa-licz > em{font-style:normal;font-size:13px;color:var(--t3)}
  .sa-licz > b.tik{animation:sa-tik .45s ease-out}
  @keyframes sa-tik{0%{color:var(--ziel-c);transform:translateY(-2px)}100%{color:var(--t1);transform:none}}

  /* =====================================================================
     HERO · rozkładówka dokumentu strategii
     Okładka pod spodem, rozkładówka str. 3–4, na wierzchu kartka z decyzją.
     Lewa strona: pomysły z działów, ołówek skreśla odrzucone i dopisuje
     powód, przyjęte dostają kółko i numer. Prawa: kolejność składa się na
     swoich miejscach, paski celów rosną. Stan w markupie to stan końcowy
     (bez JS i przy reduced-motion); stany startowe tylko pod .gra.
     ===================================================================== */
  .hs{--pap:#fffdf8;--olo:#5c635f;--atr:#26408b;--t1:#141a16;--t2:#4b544e;--t3:#7a827c;--t4:#a3a9a4;--lin:rgba(15,26,20,0.13);--lin2:rgba(15,26,20,0.065);--zl:#00cd77;--zlc:#0a7a52;
    position:relative;container:hs / inline-size;color:var(--t1);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  /* dół: kartka decyzji wisi pod rozkładówką i zachodzi tylko na stopkę
     prawej strony, nie na pozycję 06 */
  .hs-sc{position:relative;max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:50px 0 10.5em;font-size:12px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-0.003em}
  /* okładka */
  .hs-okl{position:absolute;left:0;top:12px;width:54%;height:58%;padding:13px 16px 0 21px;border-radius:3px 9px 9px 3px;color:#ffffff;transform:rotate(-3.6deg);transform-origin:0 0;
    background:radial-gradient(140% 90% at 100% 0%,rgba(0,205,119,0.2),rgba(0,205,119,0) 55%),linear-gradient(172deg,#153826 0%,#0a1d13 55%,#07140d 100%);
    box-shadow:inset 5px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05),inset 6px 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.35),0 26px 46px -24px rgba(7,20,13,0.7)}
  .hs-okl-gl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .hs-okl-gl svg{display:block;flex-shrink:0;width:13px;height:13px;fill:var(--zl)}
  .hs-okl-gl b{font-size:1.3em;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em}
  .hs-okl-gl em{margin-left:auto;font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.78em;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)}
  .hs-okl p{margin:22px 0 0;font-size:1.05em;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)}
  /* rozkładówka: dwie strony, grzbiet z cieniem, grubość bloku pod spodem */
  .hs-rozk{position:relative;z-index:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));margin-left:5%;border-radius:2px 2px 3px 3px;background:var(--pap);
    box-shadow:0 1px 0 #e7e5dc,0 2px 0 #fbfaf5,0 3px 0 #e2e0d6,0 4px 0 #f7f6f0,0 5px 0 #dad8ce,0 6px 1px rgba(15,26,20,0.1),0 42px 70px -34px rgba(15,26,20,0.48),0 16px 30px -18px rgba(15,26,20,0.22)}
  .hs-rozk::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;border-radius:inherit;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(15,26,20,0.04),rgba(15,26,20,0) 3%,rgba(15,26,20,0) 97%,rgba(15,26,20,0.04))}
  .hs-rozk::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;bottom:-5px;left:50%;width:58px;margin-left:-29px;pointer-events:none;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(15,26,20,0) 0%,rgba(15,26,20,0.03) 36%,rgba(15,26,20,0.11) 49%,rgba(255,255,255,0.7) 50.6%,rgba(15,26,20,0.04) 60%,rgba(15,26,20,0) 100%)}
  .hs-str{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;padding:15px 24px 11px 20px}
  .hs-str.p{padding:15px 20px 11px 24px}
  .hs-pag{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding-bottom:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin);font-size:0.78em;color:var(--t3);white-space:nowrap}
  .hs-pag span{min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  .hs-str h3{margin:11px 0 0;font-size:1.32em;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.022em;line-height:1.15;text-wrap:balance}
  .hs-pod{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:0.84em;color:var(--t3)}
  .hs-sto{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:auto;padding-top:9px;font-size:0.8em;color:var(--t3)}
  .hs-sto > span:last-child{font-family:var(--mono)}
  .hs-sto b{font-weight:700;color:var(--t1);transition:opacity .4s ease}
  /* lewa strona: lista z działów */
  .hs-lista{margin:9px 0 6px;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid var(--lin)}
  .hs-p{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.1em minmax(0,1fr) auto;column-gap:6px;align-items:baseline;padding:3px 2px 3px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin2);transition:background .3s ease}
  .hs-nr{grid-row:1 / 3;align-self:center;justify-self:center;position:relative;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.8em;color:var(--t3);transition:color .3s ease}
  .hs-p b{grid-column:2 / 4;position:relative;justify-self:start;max-width:100%;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;transition:color .3s ease}
  .hs-p small{grid-column:2;min-width:0;font-size:0.8em;line-height:1.2;color:var(--t4);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  .hs-p em{grid-column:3;font-size:0.86em;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap;transition:opacity .35s ease}
  .hs-p.x b{font-weight:500;color:var(--t2)}
  .hs-p.x b::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:-1px;right:-1px;top:56%;height:1.3px;border-radius:1px;background:var(--olo);opacity:0.85;transform:rotate(-0.7deg);transform-origin:0 50%;transition:transform .38s cubic-bezier(.5,0,.3,1)}
  .hs-p.x em{font-style:italic;color:var(--olo)}
  .hs-p.ok em{font-style:normal;font-weight:650;color:var(--zlc)}
  .hs-p.ok .hs-nr{color:var(--zlc);font-weight:600}
  .hs-ring{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:2.8em;height:1.9em;transform:translate(-50%,-52%);overflow:visible}
  .hs-ring path{fill:none;stroke:var(--zl);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-dasharray:1 1;transition:stroke-dashoffset .5s ease}
  .hs-p.akt{background:rgba(15,26,20,0.05)}
  .hs-dal{margin:0 0 4px;padding-left:calc(2.1em + 6px);font-size:0.84em;color:var(--t3);transition:opacity .35s ease}
  .hs-dal span{font-weight:650;color:var(--zlc)}
  /* prawa strona: kolejność */
  .hs-cele{display:grid;gap:4px;margin-top:10px;padding:8px 0 9px;border-top:1px solid var(--lin);border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin)}
  .hs-cel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 27% 2.7em;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:0.86em}
  .hs-cel span{min-width:0;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:var(--t2)}
  .hs-cel span em{margin-right:5px;font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.9em;color:var(--t4)}
  .hs-cel i{display:block;height:5px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(15,26,20,0.08);overflow:hidden}
  .hs-cel s{display:block;width:calc(var(--p) * 1%);height:100%;border-radius:3px;background:var(--zl);transition:width .8s cubic-bezier(.3,.8,.3,1)}
  .hs-cel b{text-align:right;font-weight:650;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .hs-kol{margin:2px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .hs-k{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:2em minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:8px;align-items:start;padding:7px 2px 7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin2)}
  .hs-k > em{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.95em;font-weight:600;color:var(--zlc);line-height:1.3}
  /* cel i start w jednym wierszu z paskiem miesięcy (paski w jednej kolumnie) */
  .hs-kt{min-width:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 7.5em;column-gap:10px;align-items:center}
  .hs-kt b{grid-column:1 / -1;display:block;font-weight:650;line-height:1.25;text-wrap:balance}
  .hs-kt small{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:0.8em;color:var(--t3);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  .hs-ms{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.5px;margin-top:2px}
  .hs-ms i{display:block;height:3.5px;border-radius:1px;background:rgba(15,26,20,0.07)}
  .hs-ms i.p{background:rgba(0,205,119,0.32)}
  .hs-ms i.s{background:var(--zl)}
  .hs-k strong{font-size:1.1em;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1.2}
  .hs-k > *{transition:opacity .4s ease}
  .hs-pl{position:absolute;left:2.6em;right:3.4em;top:9px;display:grid;gap:6px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
  .hs-pl::before,.hs-pl::after{content:"";display:block;height:5px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(15,26,20,0.075)}
  .hs-pl::before{width:78%}
  .hs-pl::after{width:46%}
  .hs-k.bl{animation:hs-bl 1.6s ease-out both}
  @keyframes hs-bl{0%{background:rgba(0,205,119,0.2)}100%{background:rgba(0,205,119,0)}}
  /* kartka z decyzją zarządu */
  .hs-dec{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:-2px;bottom:4px;width:min(45%,266px);padding:15px 16px 11px 17px;border-radius:2px;background:#ffffff;font-size:0.94em;color:var(--t2);
    transform:rotate(2.4deg);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(15,26,20,0.14),0 26px 46px -18px rgba(15,26,20,0.5);transition:opacity .45s ease,transform .65s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
  .hs-dec > b{display:block;font-size:1.08em;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.012em;color:var(--t1)}
  .hs-dec ul{margin:7px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .hs-dec li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:7px;padding:2px 0;line-height:1.3}
  .hs-dec li svg{display:block;flex-shrink:0;width:1.15em;height:1.15em;overflow:visible}
  .hs-dec li rect{fill:none;stroke:rgba(15,26,20,0.35);stroke-width:1.2}
  .hs-dec li path{fill:none;stroke:var(--atr);stroke-width:1.9;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:1 1;transition:stroke-dashoffset .3s ease .15s}
  .hs-dec li + li path{transition-delay:.45s}
  .hs-podp{margin-top:5px}
  .hs-podp svg{display:block;width:70%;height:auto;overflow:visible}
  .hs-podp path{fill:none;stroke:var(--atr);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:1 1;transition:stroke-dashoffset 1.1s cubic-bezier(.5,0,.4,1) .75s}
  .hs-podp path.b{transition-duration:.4s;transition-delay:1.85s}
  .hs-podp span{display:block;margin-top:1px;padding-top:4px;border-top:1px solid var(--lin);font-size:0.82em;color:var(--t3)}
  .hs-spin{position:absolute;top:-16px;left:26px;width:13px;height:34px;overflow:visible}
  .hs-spin path{fill:none;stroke:#98a09b;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round}
  /* stany startowe pętli */
  .hs.gra .hs-p:not(.on) b::after{transform:scaleX(0) rotate(-0.7deg)}
  .hs.gra .hs-p:not(.on) em{opacity:0}
  .hs.gra .hs-p:not(.on) .hs-ring path{stroke-dashoffset:1}
  .hs.gra .hs-p:not(.on) b{font-weight:600;color:var(--t1)}
  .hs.gra .hs-p:not(.on) .hs-nr{color:var(--t3);font-weight:400}
  .hs.gra .hs-k:not(.on) > :not(.hs-pl){opacity:0}
  .hs.gra .hs-k:not(.on) > .hs-pl{opacity:1}
  .hs.gra .hs-dal:not(.on){opacity:0}
  .hs.gra:not(.dec) .hs-dec{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px) rotate(7deg)}
  .hs.gra:not(.pod) .hs-dec path{stroke-dashoffset:1}
  .hs.zgas .hs-p em,.hs.zgas .hs-p b::after,.hs.zgas .hs-ring,.hs.zgas .hs-k > :not(.hs-pl),.hs.zgas .hs-cel s,.hs.zgas .hs-cel b,.hs.zgas .hs-dec,.hs.zgas .hs-dal,.hs.zgas .hs-sto b{opacity:0;transition:opacity .5s ease}
  .hs.bez *,.hs.bez *::after{transition:none !important;animation:none !important}
  @container hs (max-width:639px){
    .hs-sc{padding:42px 0 12em;font-size:10.5px}
    /* wąsko pasek miesięcy się nie mieści obok „cel · start" — zostaje sam opis */
    .hs-kt{display:block}
    .hs-ms{display:none}
    .hs-str{padding:12px 15px 9px 13px}
    .hs-str.p{padding:12px 13px 9px 15px}
    .hs-dec{width:min(52%,240px)}
  }
  @container hs (max-width:469px){
    .hs-sc{padding:36px 0 0;font-size:11.5px}
    .hs-okl{left:auto;right:3%;top:0;width:70%;height:170px;transform:rotate(2.6deg);transform-origin:100% 0}
    .hs-rozk{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:0;margin:0;background:none;box-shadow:none}
    .hs-rozk::before,.hs-rozk::after{display:none}
    .hs-str,.hs-str.p{padding:13px 15px 10px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--pap);
      box-shadow:0 1px 0 #e4e2d9,0 2px 0 #fbfaf5,0 3px 0 #dddbd1,0 30px 50px -30px rgba(15,26,20,0.5),0 10px 22px -14px rgba(15,26,20,0.2)}
    .hs-str.p{margin:-3px 0 0 8px}
    /* na telefonie wiersz listy w jednej linii: nazwa i dopisek, bez działu */
    .hs-p{grid-template-columns:2.1em minmax(0,1fr) auto;padding:4px 2px 4px 0}
    .hs-p b{grid-column:2}
    .hs-p small{display:none}
    .hs-p em{grid-column:3;grid-row:1;font-size:0.82em}
    .hs-nr{grid-row:1}
    .hs-dec{position:relative;right:auto;bottom:auto;width:auto;max-width:290px;margin:-14px 4px 0 auto}
  }

  /* =====================================================================
     DWIE KOLEJNOŚCI · te same pomysły po godzinach i po celach zarządu
     Lewa lista od największej oszczędności (pasek = godziny), prawa: plan
     w swojej kolejności, pod kreską to, co poza planem. Linie rysują się
     od góry lewej listy; zielone weszły do planu.
     ===================================================================== */
  .sl{container:sl / inline-size}
  .sl-uk{--rh:clamp(31px,3.3cqw,38px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) clamp(56px,16cqw,210px) minmax(0,1fr);padding:0 clamp(2px,0.8vw,14px)}
  .sl-gl{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:8px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--t1);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:650}
  .sl-gl small{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--t3);white-space:nowrap}
  .sl-gl.l{justify-content:flex-end;text-align:right}
  .sl-gl.l small{order:-1;margin-right:auto}
  .sl-gp{border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--t1);margin-bottom:8px}
  .sl-l,.sl-p{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;grid-auto-rows:var(--rh)}
  .sl-l{padding-top:calc(var(--rh) / 2)}
  .sl-l li,.sl-p li{position:relative;display:grid;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-width:0;transition:opacity .35s ease,background .3s ease}
  .sl-l li{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,0.9fr) 3.3em minmax(0,2.5fr);padding-right:12px}
  .sl-p li{grid-template-columns:1.8em minmax(0,1fr) auto;padding-left:12px}
  .sl-l li::after,.sl-p li::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:50%;width:7px;height:7px;margin-top:-3.5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c,#bcc2bc)}
  .sl-l li::after{right:-3.5px}
  .sl-p li::before{left:-3.5px}
  .sl-l li.z,.sl-p li.z{--c:var(--ziel)}
  .sl-bar{display:block;justify-self:end;width:calc(var(--w) * 1%);height:9px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(15,26,20,0.14)}
  .sl-l li.z .sl-bar{background:rgba(0,205,119,0.55)}
  .sl-l .h{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;text-align:right;color:var(--t2);white-space:nowrap}
  .sl-l b,.sl-p b{min-width:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.006em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  .sl-l b{text-align:right}
  .sl-l li.x b,.sl-p li.x b{font-weight:500;color:var(--t2)}
  .sl-p em{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ziel-c)}
  .sl-p li.x em{color:var(--t3);font-weight:400}
  .sl-p small{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--t3);white-space:nowrap}
  .sl-p li.z small{color:var(--ziel-c);font-weight:600}
  .sl-p li.sep{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:0 0 5px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;color:var(--t3);border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(15,26,20,0.22)}
  .sl-p li.sep::before{display:none}
  .sl-svg{display:block;width:100%;height:calc(var(--rh) * 13);overflow:visible}
  .sl-svg path{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-dasharray:1 1;transition:stroke-dashoffset .6s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.3,1)}
  .sl-svg path.z{stroke:var(--ziel);stroke-width:2.4}
  .sl-svg path.x{stroke:rgba(15,26,20,0.2);stroke-width:1.6}
  .sl.gra .sl-svg path:not(.on){stroke-dashoffset:1}
  .sl.gra .sl-l li:not(.on),.sl.gra .sl-p li:not(.on):not(.sep){opacity:0.32}
  .sl.gra .sl-l li.akt{opacity:1;background:rgba(15,26,20,0.04)}
  @container sl (max-width:640px){
    .sl-uk{--rh:36px;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 40px minmax(0,1fr);padding:0}
    .sl-gl{font-size:12px;line-height:1.25}
    .sl-gl small{display:none}
    .sl-l li{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:0;padding-right:9px;align-content:center}
    .sl-l li .sl-bar{display:none}
    .sl-l .h{order:2;font-size:11px;line-height:1.2}
    .sl-l b,.sl-p b{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.25}
    .sl-p li{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:0;padding-left:9px;align-content:center}
    .sl-p em{font-size:11px;line-height:1.2;order:2}
    .sl-p small{display:none}
    .sl-p li.sep{padding-left:9px}
    .sl-p li.x em{display:none}
  }

  /* =====================================================================
     TARCZA PIERWSZEGO ROKU · pozycja 02
     Okrąg to dwanaście miesięcy. Łuk do miesiąca spłaty nakładu jest
     ciemny, po nim zielony. Przerywany łuk w środku kończy się tam, gdzie
     spłatę pokazałby rachunek z samych godzin. Obok rachunek, który ją
     przesuwa. pathLength = 12, więc długości łuków to miesiące.
     ===================================================================== */
  .tr-uk{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,420px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(32px,5.6vw,96px);align-items:center;padding:0 clamp(2px,0.8vw,14px)}
  .tr-tarcza{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:420px;aspect-ratio:1}
  .tr-tarcza svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible}
  .tr-tor{fill:none;stroke:rgba(15,26,20,0.07);stroke-width:30}
  .tr-a1,.tr-a2{fill:none;stroke-width:30}
  .tr-a1{stroke:#2a3a31;stroke-dasharray:var(--a1) 12}
  .tr-a2{stroke:var(--ziel);stroke-dasharray:var(--a2) 12;stroke-dashoffset:calc(var(--a1) * -1)}
  .tr-kr{stroke:rgba(15,26,20,0.28);stroke-width:1.5}
  .tr-m{font-family:'Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;fill:var(--t3);text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:central}
  .tr-duch{fill:none;stroke:rgba(15,26,20,0.45);stroke-width:2;stroke-dasharray:4 5;stroke-linecap:round}
  .tr-duch-k{fill:rgba(15,26,20,0.55)}
  .tr-spl{stroke:#ffffff;stroke-width:3}
  .tr-sr{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;pointer-events:none}
  .tr-sr b{font-size:clamp(48px,5.2vw,72px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.055em;line-height:0.95;color:var(--t1)}
  .tr-sr > span{margin-top:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--t2)}
  .tr-sr em{margin-top:14px;padding-top:10px;max-width:170px;border-top:1.5px dashed rgba(15,26,20,0.3);font-style:normal;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--t3)}
  .tr-r{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:1.5px solid var(--t1)}
  .tr-r li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:3px 20px;padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linia)}
  .tr-r b{font-size:clamp(15px,1.25vw,16.5px);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-0.012em;line-height:1.3}
  .tr-r small{grid-column:1;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:4px 8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--t3)}
  .tr-r li > span{grid-row:1 / 3;grid-column:2;align-self:center;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;white-space:nowrap}
  .tr-r li.duch b,.tr-r li.duch > span{color:var(--t3)}
  .tr-r li.duch > span{text-decoration:underline dashed rgba(15,26,20,0.35);text-underline-offset:5px}
  .tr-my{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:2px 8px 2px 5px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ink);color:#ffffff;font-size:11px;font-weight:650}
  .tr-my svg{display:block;width:11px;height:11px;fill:var(--ziel)}
  .tr-r li.suma{border-top:1.5px solid var(--t1);border-bottom:0;margin-top:-1px}
  .tr-r li.suma b{font-size:clamp(16px,1.35vw,18px);font-weight:700}
  .tr-r li.suma > span{font-size:clamp(26px,2.4vw,34px);letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:var(--t1)}
  .tr.gra .tr-r li{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}
  .tr.gra.on .tr-r li{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:opacity .45s ease calc(var(--i) * 0.2s + 0.1s),transform .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) calc(var(--i) * 0.2s + 0.1s)}
  .tr.gra .tr-a1,.tr.gra .tr-a2{stroke-dasharray:0 12}
  .tr.gra.on .tr-a1{stroke-dasharray:var(--a1) 12;transition:stroke-dasharray var(--t1s) linear var(--t0)}
  .tr.gra.on .tr-a2{stroke-dasharray:var(--a2) 12;transition:stroke-dasharray var(--t2s) linear var(--t2)}
  .tr.gra .tr-duch,.tr.gra .tr-duch-k,.tr.gra .tr-spl,.tr.gra .tr-sr > *{opacity:0}
  .tr.gra.on .tr-duch,.tr.gra.on .tr-duch-k,.tr.gra.on .tr-sr em{opacity:1;transition:opacity .4s ease var(--td)}
  .tr.gra.on .tr-spl,.tr.gra.on .tr-sr b,.tr.gra.on .tr-sr > span{opacity:1;transition:opacity .45s ease var(--t2)}
  @media (max-width:980px){
    .tr-uk{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);justify-items:center}
    .tr-tarcza{max-width:360px}
    .tr-r{width:100%}
  }

  /* =====================================================================
     DOKUMENT STRATEGII · stos kartek na ciemnym blacie
     Pięć stron w jednej komórce siatki, kolejność w stosie w --g (0 =
     wierzch). Przekładki po prawej (na wąskim ekranie nad stosem) wysuwają
     wybraną kartkę spod stosu i kładą ją na wierzchu; potem zakreślacz
     zaznacza na niej jedno miejsce. Pod stosem widać tylko papier, treść
     ma tylko kartka z wierzchu. Bez JS: rachunek na wierzchu, wszystko
     zakreślone.
     ===================================================================== */
  .sd-blat{background:radial-gradient(1000px 640px at 46% 46%,rgba(255,255,255,0.06),rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%),radial-gradient(1100px 620px at 50% 108%,rgba(0,205,119,0.16),rgba(0,205,119,0) 70%),var(--ink)}
  .sd{--t1:#141a16;--t2:#4b544e;--t3:#7a827c;--t4:#a3a9a4;--lin:rgba(15,26,20,0.12);--lin2:rgba(15,26,20,0.065);--zl:#00cd77;--zlc:#0a7a52;--pap:#fffdf8;--atr:#26408b;
    margin-top:clamp(40px,4.6vw,64px);container:sd / inline-size}
  .sd-in{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) clamp(126px,11cqw,158px);align-items:start;max-width:1220px}
  .sd-stos{position:relative;display:grid;min-width:0;container:sdk / inline-size;color:var(--t1);font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:-0.003em}
  .sd-k{grid-area:1 / 1;position:relative;z-index:calc(10 - var(--g));display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;padding:clamp(18px,3.4cqw,42px) clamp(18px,4.2cqw,54px) clamp(14px,2.2cqw,26px);border-radius:2px;background:var(--pap);
    transform:translate(calc(min(var(--g),3) * -9px),calc(min(var(--g),3) * 11px)) rotate(calc(min(var(--g),3) * var(--r)));
    filter:brightness(calc(1 - min(var(--g),4) * 0.045));
    box-shadow:0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.25),0 60px 100px -46px rgba(0,0,0,0.85),0 22px 44px -26px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.3,.8,.3,1),filter .4s ease}
  .sd-k:not(.akt) > *{visibility:hidden}
  #jak-wyglada .v3-jw-dol{margin-top:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
  .sd-k::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;border-radius:inherit;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(15,26,20,0.035),rgba(15,26,20,0) 2.5%,rgba(15,26,20,0) 97.5%,rgba(15,26,20,0.03))}
  /* przekładki */
  .sd-zak{position:relative;z-index:12;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding-top:clamp(26px,3.6cqw,52px)}
  .sd-zak button{appearance:none;border:0;font:inherit;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;margin-left:-3px;padding:11px 12px 11px 17px;border-radius:0 9px 9px 0;
    background:#cdd1c8;color:#28312b;transform:translateX(-6px);box-shadow:inset 8px 0 10px -8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);transition:transform .25s ease,background .2s ease}
  .sd-zak button b{font-size:14px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
  .sd-zak button span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:#5a635c}
  .sd-zak button:hover{transform:translateX(-2px);background:#e2e5dc}
  .sd-zak button[aria-selected="true"]{background:var(--pap);transform:none;box-shadow:none}
  .sd-zak button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ziel);outline-offset:2px}
  /* druk: żywa pagina, tytuł części, folio */
  .sd-glw,.sd-fol{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;font-size:12px;color:var(--t3);white-space:nowrap}
  .sd-glw{padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin)}
  .sd-glw span,.sd-fol span{min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  .sd-fol{margin-top:auto;padding-top:22px;color:var(--t4)}
  .sd-fol em{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px}
  .sd-tyt{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;margin-top:clamp(18px,2.8cqw,32px)}
  .sd-tyt > em{padding-top:24px;font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--zlc)}
  .sd-tyt small{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;color:var(--zlc)}
  .sd-tyt h3{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:clamp(21px,2.7cqw,30px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.12;text-wrap:balance}
  .sd-tyt p{margin:7px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--t3)}
  .sd-h4{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:650;color:var(--t3)}
  .sd-my{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:6px;vertical-align:-0.5px;fill:var(--zlc)}
  /* zakreślacz */
  .sd-zk{padding:0 3px;margin:0 -3px;border-radius:3px;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;background-image:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(0,205,119,0) 0,rgba(0,205,119,0.42) 2%,rgba(0,205,119,0.34) 97%,rgba(0,205,119,0) 100%);
    background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:0 72%;background-size:100% 64%;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone}
  .sd.gra .sd-k:not(.zk) .sd-zk{background-size:0% 64%}
  .sd.gra .sd-k.zk .sd-zk{transition:background-size .75s cubic-bezier(.5,0,.3,1) .2s}
  /* rachunek */
  .sd-rach{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.55fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(22px,4.2cqw,60px);margin-top:clamp(18px,2.8cqw,30px)}
  .sd-w{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) 84px minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;align-items:baseline;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin2)}
  .sd-w.n{padding:0 0 6px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:650;color:var(--t3);border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--t1)}
  .sd-w > :nth-child(2){font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}
  .sd-w.n > :nth-child(2){font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-weight:inherit}
  .sd-w .z{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--t3)}
  .sd-w .z.my{font-weight:600;color:var(--t1)}
  .sd-o{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:1px 14px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin2)}
  .sd-o span{color:var(--t2)}
  .sd-o small{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--t4)}
  .sd-o b{grid-row:1 / 3;grid-column:2;align-self:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
  .sd-o.suma{border-top:1.5px solid var(--t1);border-bottom:3px double var(--t1)}
  .sd-o.suma span{font-weight:650;color:var(--t1)}
  .sd-o.suma b{font-size:14.5px}
  .sd-zw{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;margin-top:16px}
  .sd-zw span{color:var(--t2)}
  .sd-zw span em{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-style:normal;font-weight:650;color:var(--t1)}
  .sd-zw b{font-size:clamp(36px,4.6cqw,52px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.05em;line-height:0.9}
  .sd-pod{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.55fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(22px,4.2cqw,60px);margin-top:clamp(22px,2.8cqw,32px);padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(15,26,20,0.2)}
  .sd-pod ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .sd-pod li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:2px 14px;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin2);font-size:12.5px}
  .sd-pod li b{font-weight:600}
  .sd-pod li span{color:var(--t3);text-align:right}
  .sd-pod p:not(.sd-h4){margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--t2)}
  /* kolejność */
  .sd-cele{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,3cqw,40px);margin-top:clamp(16px,2.4cqw,26px);padding:14px 0 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--lin);border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin)}
  .sd-cel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:6px 12px;align-items:center;min-width:0}
  .sd-cel span{min-width:0;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.25}
  .sd-cel span em{display:block;font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:400;color:var(--t4)}
  .sd-cel strong{font-size:clamp(20px,2.4cqw,26px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1}
  .sd-cel i{grid-column:1 / -1;display:block;height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(15,26,20,0.08);overflow:hidden}
  .sd-cel s{display:block;width:calc(var(--p) * 1%);height:100%;border-radius:3px;background:var(--zl)}
  .sd-cel small{grid-column:1 / -1;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--t3)}
  .sd-kr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px minmax(0,1.55fr) 48px minmax(0,1.15fr) 66px;gap:16px;align-items:center;min-height:50px;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin2)}
  .sd-kr.n{min-height:0;padding:12px 0 6px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:650;color:var(--t3);border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--t1)}
  .sd-kr > em{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--zlc)}
  .sd-kr > span{min-width:0}
  .sd-kr > span b{display:block;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  .sd-kr > span small{display:block;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--t3);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  .sd-kr > i{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--t3)}
  .sd-kr > strong{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}
  .sd-kr.n > :last-child{text-align:right}
  .sd-mies{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr));gap:2px}
  .sd-mies i{display:block;height:14px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(15,26,20,0.045)}
  .sd-mies i.p{background:rgba(0,205,119,0.26)}
  .sd-mies i.s{background:var(--zl)}
  .sd-mies.n{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .sd-mies.n span{padding-left:3px;border-left:1px solid var(--lin);font-weight:500}
  /* odrzucone */
  .sd-x{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(0,1.2fr);gap:18px;align-items:baseline;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin2);font-size:12.5px}
  .sd-x.n{margin-top:clamp(16px,2.4cqw,26px);padding:0 0 6px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:650;color:var(--t3);border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--t1)}
  .sd-x b{font-weight:600}
  .sd-x small{margin-left:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--t4);white-space:nowrap}
  .sd-x .pw{color:var(--t2)}
  .sd-x .za{color:var(--zlc);font-weight:600}
  .sd-x .za.nic{color:var(--t4);font-weight:400}
  /* ryzyka */
  .sd-ry{display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px minmax(0,1.3fr) minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(0,0.85fr) 118px;gap:18px;align-items:baseline;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin2);font-size:12.5px}
  .sd-ry.n{margin-top:clamp(16px,2.4cqw,26px);padding:0 0 6px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:650;color:var(--t3);border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--t1)}
  .sd-ry > em{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--zlc)}
  .sd-ry .w{color:var(--t2)}
  .sd-ry .k{font-weight:600}
  .sd-ry .k.my{color:var(--zlc)}
  .sd-ry .d{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--t3)}
  /* plan kwartału i decyzja */
  .sd-pl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,3.4cqw,44px);margin-top:clamp(16px,2.4cqw,26px)}
  .sd-pl > div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:4px 12px;padding-top:12px;border-top:2px solid var(--t1)}
  .sd-pl em{grid-row:1 / 3;font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:clamp(22px,2.8cqw,30px);font-weight:600;line-height:1;color:var(--zlc)}
  .sd-pl b{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.012em;line-height:1.3}
  .sd-pl small{font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--t3)}
  .sd-war{margin-top:clamp(18px,2.6cqw,28px)}
  .sd-wr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px minmax(0,1.8fr) minmax(0,1fr) 128px;gap:16px;align-items:baseline;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lin2);font-size:12.5px}
  .sd-wr.n{padding:0 0 6px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:650;color:var(--t3);border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--t1)}
  .sd-wr > em{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--zlc)}
  .sd-wr .k{font-weight:600}
  .sd-wr .k.my{color:var(--zlc)}
  .sd-wr .d{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--t3)}
  .sd-dz{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.3fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(18px,3.4cqw,44px);margin-top:clamp(20px,2.8cqw,32px);padding:16px 20px 14px;border:1.5px solid var(--t1);border-radius:2px}
  .sd-dz > div > b{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
  .sd-dz p{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--t2)}
  .sd-dz ul{margin:10px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .sd-dz li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;padding:3px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
  .sd-dz li svg{display:block;flex-shrink:0;width:15px;height:15px;margin-top:1px;overflow:visible}
  .sd-dz li rect{fill:none;stroke:rgba(15,26,20,0.4);stroke-width:1.2}
  .sd-dz li path{fill:none;stroke:var(--atr);stroke-width:1.9;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:1 1}
  .sd-pdp{align-self:end}
  .sd-pdp svg{display:block;width:min(100%,220px);height:auto;overflow:visible}
  .sd-pdp path{fill:none;stroke:var(--atr);stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:1 1}
  .sd-pdp span{display:block;margin-top:2px;padding-top:5px;border-top:1px solid var(--t2);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--t3)}
  .sd.gra .sd-k:not(.zk) .sd-dz path,.sd.gra .sd-k:not(.zk) .sd-pdp path{stroke-dashoffset:1}
  .sd.gra .sd-k.zk .sd-dz li path{transition:stroke-dashoffset .3s ease .35s}
  .sd.gra .sd-k.zk .sd-dz li + li path{transition-delay:.6s}
